ice mode will let you learn the ins-and-outs of these courses once you open them up within competition.", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/test-drive-off-road", "videos": [{"id": 178266, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "fdzJCFGfKV4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdzJCFGfKV4", "title": "Test Drive Off Road (PSX)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fdzJCFGfKV4/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 588, "name": "Test Drive"}, {"id": 12783, "name": "Test Drive: Off-Road"}]}